1
00:00:05,912 --> 00:00:07,333
Welcome to PatientVoice

2
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:12,089
an ambient clinical agent designed to prevent hospital readmissions following

3
00:00:12,089 --> 00:00:13,695
joint replacement surgery.

4
00:00:13,695 --> 00:00:17,958
Over two million patients undergo hip and knee arthroplasty each year

5
00:00:17,958 --> 00:00:22,714
yet post-discharge complications often go undetected until patients arrive in

6
00:00:22,714 --> 00:00:23,888
the Emergency Room.

7
00:00:29,047 --> 00:00:31,361
Let's explore the Patient Interface

8
00:00:31,361 --> 00:00:35,263
designed for zero-friction daily voice and wound check-ins.

9
00:00:37,563 --> 00:00:40,602
Patients simply speak for under 90 seconds.

10
00:00:40,602 --> 00:00:47,032
The Web Speech API transcribes speech in real time with a live harmonic waveform visualizer

11
00:00:47,032 --> 00:00:51,060
automatically extracting pain scores, ambulation distance

12
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,827
and medication adherence.

13
00:00:57,977 --> 00:01:01,602
Patients take a daily photo of their surgical incision.

14
00:01:01,602 --> 00:01:05,227
Our computer vision engine analyzes the erythema margin

15
00:01:05,227 --> 00:01:07,007
checks staple approximation

16
00:01:07,007 --> 00:01:11,489
and detects purulent drainage compared against their Day 0 baseline.

17
00:01:17,384 --> 00:01:21,887
Crucially, PatientVoice incorporates deterministic clinical guardrails.

18
00:01:21,887 --> 00:01:27,532
When a patient reports critical symptoms like acute calf swelling indicating a blood clot

19
00:01:27,532 --> 00:01:32,098
the system instantly bypasses generative chat and activates an emergency

20
00:01:32,098 --> 00:01:34,952
red-line protocol with one-touch 911 dialing.

21
00:01:44,347 --> 00:01:47,176
Now let's switch to the Clinician Triage Hub

22
00:01:47,176 --> 00:01:52,321
where on-call orthopedic nurses and surgical fellows manage their active patient

23
00:01:52,321 --> 00:01:52,771
cohort.

24
00:01:55,973 --> 00:01:58,652
Patients are sorted by urgency priority.

25
00:01:58,652 --> 00:02:03,743
Clinicians can inspect side-by-side and interactive split-slider wound diffs

26
00:02:03,743 --> 00:02:09,034
comparing Day 0 In-OR baseline photos with today's capture to quantify erythema

27
00:02:09,034 --> 00:02:10,709
expansion in millimeters.

28
00:02:18,855 --> 00:02:22,953
The hub visualizes multi-day pain and mobility biomarker curves

29
00:02:22,953 --> 00:02:26,596
automatically synthesizes structured SBAR clinical notes

30
00:02:26,596 --> 00:02:31,605
and provides one-click order dispatch to dispatch home health nurses or order

31
00:02:31,605 --> 00:02:33,231
STAT Doppler ultrasounds.

32
00:02:41,188 --> 00:02:45,383
PatientVoice is built for real-world healthcare interoperability

33
00:02:45,383 --> 00:02:50,365
generating validated HL7 FHIR Release 4 ClinicalImpression bundles mapped to

34
00:02:50,365 --> 00:02:55,084
SNOMED CT and LOINC ontologies for seamless Epic and Cerner integration.

35
00:03:04,202 --> 00:03:06,067
On the Emergency Rules page

36
00:03:06,067 --> 00:03:12,700
clinicians and judges can interactively test the deterministic safety matrix across DVT symptoms

37
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:17,882
pyrexia thresholds, and wound dehiscence to verify zero hallucination risk.

38
00:03:23,617 --> 00:03:27,300
PatientVoice bridges the post-discharge surveillance gap

39
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:31,444
protecting orthopedic patients, streamlining clinical workflows

40
00:03:31,444 --> 00:03:36,639
and saving healthcare systems thousands of dollars in preventable readmissions.

41
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,297
Thank you.
